    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Warrior of the Living Weapon or Monk<br /><hr />You alter your physical anatomy—extending sinew, elongating bone spurs, or unfurling symbiotic lashers. While in this stance, the only Strikes you can make are tendril whip unarmed attacks. These deal 1d6 piercing or slashing damage; have the agile, finesse, reach 10 ft, and trip traits; and are in the brawling weapon group.</p>"
